    example: 'Job A starts with random weights and ordinary text. B continues text training from an existing checkpoint. C learns from approved question-answer pairs. D learns from preferred and rejected replies.', question: 'How do the jobs differ?', result: 'A is from-scratch pretraining; B is continued pretraining; C is supervised fine-tuning; D is preference training.',
